p01 : 256.54
p03 : 8.57
p04 : 61.75
p07 : V4.4
p08 : US Blanks 8'4"SP (2010 catalog vector extraction; target 85.2 L)
p97 : This collaboration is the lastest product of three decades of working together in one form or another. The 8’4SP was modeled after the Clark 8’3E with slightly more width in the nose for noserider style templates. Neutral tail rocker and improved curve in the bottom rocker from center to nose provide versatility for boards in the 8’0” to 8’4” size range. Parrish
